.TH "webveld\-profile\-check" "1" "2026\-11\-02" "WebVeld 0.10.1" "User Commands"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
webveld\-profile\-check \- profile conformance checker for webveld\-nano and webveld\-pico
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBwebveld\-profile\-check\fR [\fB\-\-profile\fR=\fInano\fR|\fIpico\fR] \fIFILE\fR.\&.\&.\&
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBwebveld\-profile\-check\fR checks HTML and CSS files against the WebVeld
restriction profiles:
.PP
\fBwebveld\-nano\fR
.RS 4
Styled documents: linear\-flow box model, typography, colors, same\-origin
PNG/JPEG images, and light/dark color schemes.\& No flexbox, grid, tables,
forms, or width\-based media queries.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBwebveld\-pico\fR
.RS 4
Semantic hypertext: headings, paragraphs, lists, quotes, preformatted
text, and links.\& No author CSS and no subresources.\&
.PP
.RE
A profile only removes features from the WebVeld specification; it never
adds or redefines anything, so every conforming profile document is also a
conforming WebVeld document.\& \fBwebveld\-profile\-check\fR assumes its input
already passes \fBwebveld\-validate\fR(1), and checks the profile'\&s further
restrictions:
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBR1 Elements\fR: elements outside the profile are rejected.\&
.IP \(bu 4
\fBR2 Attributes\fR: attributes outside the profile are rejected.\& In pico,
the only \fBmeta\fR name is \fBviewport\fR, with exactly
\fIwidth=device\-width, initial\-scale=1\fR.\&
.IP \(bu 4
\fBR3 Style sheets\fR: in pico, author style sheets are rejected entirely.\& In
nano, properties, selectors, and at\-rules outside the profile are
rejected, and narrowed values (\fBdisplay: none\fR only) are enforced.\&
.PD
.PP
On every run, a drift guard compares the checker'\&s lists with the profile
documents and warns if they disagree.\&
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB\-\-profile\fR=\fInano\fR|\fIpico\fR
.RS 4
The profile to check against.\& The default is \fBnano\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.PP
\fB0\fR
.RS 4
Every file conforms to the profile.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB1\fR
.RS 4
At least one file breaks a profile restriction, or the options were
invalid.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.PP
\fBWEBVELD_PROFILE_DOC\fR
.RS 4
Path to the profile document used by the drift guard.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Check a document and a style sheet against nano:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
webveld\-profile\-check page\&.html style\&.css
.fi
.RE
.PP
Check a document against pico:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
webveld\-profile\-check \-\-profile=pico text\-only\&.html
.fi
.RE
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBwebveld\-validate\fR(1), \fBwebveld\fR(7)
